label "Termination and exit conditions diagram"
box loop 16 80 120 60 "loop|iteration"
box gate 180 66 120 88 "exit check|done · turn cap|blocker" acc
box done 340 40 100 40 "done"
box cut 340 96 100 40 "turn limit|error"
box human 340 152 100 40 "human"
arrow loop gate
arrow gate done
arrow gate cut
arrow gate human
arrow gate loop dashed via=240,200;76,200
note "decide every exit in advance: final output, turn limit, human pause"
